+# GoalDetailClaim.tsx
+
+`GoalDetailClaim` mounts `/folder/:encodedCwd/goals/:goalId`.
+Definition, status controls, linked sessions, editable criteria, newest-first verdicts.
+`resolveGoalTurns` supplies gauge; terminal status uses durable progress.
+`goal-turn-limit-edit` opens cumulative total editor beside Turns.
+Save validates safe integer above current cap and cumulative/local spent turns.
+PATCH merges `budget.maxTurns`; retains spend cap, status, history and counters.
+Save starts no work; paused goal requires separate Resume.
+Draft binds Goal ID; functional identity guard isolates stale save replies.
+Errors retain draft; accessible label, help and error IDs bind input.
+Controls dispatch `sendPluginAction`; delete requires confirm.
+See change: sophisticate-goal-authoring-and-control; goal-status-sync.
