+# useGoals.ts — index
+
+`useGoals(cwd)` fetches folder records, then consumes typed `goals_update` from host socket.
+Matching push replaces full array, including empty; aborts older REST request.
+Folder switch and unmount abort reads and remove subscriptions/listeners.
+Reconnect, focus and visible-tab events coalesce recovery GET within 100 ms.
+`refetch` retains explicit mutation/Refresh path. No polling or additional socket.
+`statusMeta(status)` maps durable lifecycle status to label/dot/classes.
+
+Board/Detail use cached driver snapshots only while durable goal pursues; paused/terminal records retain durable counts and status.
